  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> form an equilateral triangle, then we know that,<br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Case-I:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />Case-II:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> (not possible because <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> )<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> is the only solution",
